msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署 {: #5-online-service-deployment }"

msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 单节点在线部署"

msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs text and image embedding on one Atlas 300I DUO "
"node, suitable for development, testing, and online `/v1/embeddings` "
"serving."
msgstr "单节点部署在单个 Atlas 300I DUO 节点上运行文本和图像嵌入，适用于开发、测试和在线 `/v1/embeddings` 服务。"

msgid "Startup command:"
msgstr "启动命令："

msgid "Required Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "必需参数说明："

msgid ""
"- `--compilation-config` For Atlas 300I DUO, due to limited hardware "
"streams, the size of cudagraph_capture_sizes is restricted."
msgstr ""
"- `--compilation-config` 对于 Atlas 300I DUO，由于硬件流数量有限，cudagraph_capture_sizes"
" 的大小受到限制。"

msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"- **Tensor parallelism (TP) is not supported** for SigLIP2 online serving. Do not set `--tensor-parallel-size`; deploy on a single Atlas 300I DUO NPU as shown above.\n"
"- `--served-model-name` must match the `\"model\"` field in `/v1/embeddings` requests; use the same value as `MODEL_PATH`.\n"
"- `--runner pooling` is required. SigLIP2 is an embedding model, not a generative LLM.\n"
"- `--max-model-len 64` matches SigLIP2 text tokenization (`padding=max_length`, `max_length=64`).\n"
"- `--chat-template template_basic.jinja` is required when sending images via `messages` on `/v1/embeddings`.\n"
"- `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\": 1}'` allows one image per request.\n"
"- For image-only embedding over HTTP, use an **empty** text prompt in `messages` or offline `prompt=\"\"` with `multi_modal_data`."
msgstr ""
"- SigLIP2 在线服务**不支持张量并行（TP）**。请勿设置 `--tensor-parallel-size`；请按照上述方式在单个 Atlas 300I DUO NPU 上部署。\n"
"- `--served-model-name` 必须与 `/v1/embeddings` 请求中的 `\"model\"` 字段匹配；请使用与 `MODEL_PATH` 相同的值。\n"
"- 必须设置 `--runner pooling`。SigLIP2 是嵌入模型，而非生成式 LLM。\n"
"- `--max-model-len 64` 与 SigLIP2 文本分词（`padding=max_length`，`max_length=64`）匹配。\n"
"- 通过 `/v1/embeddings` 的 `messages` 发送图像时，需要设置 `--chat-template template_basic.jinja`。\n"
"- `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\": 1}'` 允许每个请求包含一张图像。\n"
"- 对于仅图像的 HTTP 嵌入，请在 `messages` 中使用**空**文本提示，或在离线模式下使用 `prompt=\"\"` 并配合 `multi_modal_data`。"

msgid ""
