"deployment) 命令开始，然后调整下方的 serve 参数。"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Workload | Deployment | NPUs | Max Num Seqs | Max Num Batched "
"Tokens | Max Model Len | Client Concurrency (ref.) |"
msgstr ""
"| Scenario | Workload | Deployment | NPUs | Max Num Seqs | Max Num Batched "
"Tokens | Max Model Len | Client Concurrency (ref.) |"

